+const promisedPrice=/견적(?:은|이|가|으로)|(?:총액|단가|가격|금액)(?:은|이|는)|할인해\s*드|청구하|our (?:price|quote)|we (?:charge|offer)|will cost|price (?:is|will be)/i;
